g18 = generic 0.18 micron cmos technology.

variations
----------
g18 		- generic, 5 layer metal, .01 micron grid.
g18-NOA 	- g18, with no area rules checked.
g18-PG 		- g18, "post generation": nwell/n+ etc are not auto generated


